is kind of invisible

550
00:22:38,800 --> 00:22:40,800
because they're motivating and inspiring their team.

551
00:22:40,800 --> 00:22:42,800
so, to review what we've talked about today,

552
00:22:42,800 --> 00:22:44,800
our role as Scouters begins with

553
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:46,800
perspective,

554
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:48,800
in other words, understanding our role in the game.

555
00:22:48,800 --> 00:22:50,800
perspective defines our attitude.

556
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:52,800
how we express ourselves

557
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:54,800
is definitely a choice.

558
00:22:54,800 --> 00:22:56,800
it's not all determined by personality

559
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:58,800
and we're not powerless to overcome the negative

560
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:00,800
