573
00:23:24,800 --> 00:23:26,800
our attitude defines

574
00:23:26,800 --> 00:23:28,800
our effectiveness in achieving

575
00:23:28,800 --> 00:23:30,800
the goals of scouting,

576
00:23:30,800 --> 00:23:32,800
of developing character in young people,

577
00:23:32,800 --> 00:23:34,800
is dependent on our understanding

578
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:36,800
of these particular tools.

